                        "entry_id": "4382772b-b285-3b38-af17-f6878cb21e2d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a traditional village house in the Caucasus and Crimea"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a77931ec-cc49-456a-ab54-624d46138a98",
                                "sense_id": "67a167f0-17fd-371c-92b9-c95f9ae636f7",
                                "text": "Уж мы различали почтовую станцию, кровли окружающих её саклей, и перед нами мелькали приветные огоньки, когда пахнул сырой, холодный ветер, ущелье загудело и пошёл мелкий дождь.",
                                "translation": "We could already make out the post station and the roofs of the huts around it, and welcoming lights were dancing ahead when the gusts of cold raw wind came whistling down the gorge and it began to drizzle.",
                                "english": "We could already make out the post station and the roofs of the huts around it, and welcoming lights were dancing ahead when the gusts of cold raw wind came whistling down the gorge and it began to drizzle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
